\nType scale:\n- d1: Poppins SemiBold 28 (welcome headline)\n- h1: Poppins SemiBold 22 (screen titles)\n- h2: Poppins SemiBold 18 (section titles)\n- h3: Poppins Medium 16\n- b1: Roboto Regular 14 (body)\n- b2: Roboto Medium 14\n- cap: Roboto Regular 12\n- cap2: Roboto Medium 12 (labels)\n- tiny: Roboto Regular 11\n- num-l: Roboto Bold 24 (balance)\n- num: Roboto Medium 15\n\nComponents to build in Phase 2 (light + a few dark):\n1. \"Btn/Primary\" — from clone \"Button\" 9:136, rename. Text inside \"GET STARTED\". \n2. \"Btn/Secondary\" — clone primary, white bg, brand text, 1px brand stroke.\n3. \"Btn/Disabled\" — clone primary, #C7D2E1 bg? disabled gray #B9C4D4, text white.\n4. \"Input/Default\" — from clone \"Text Field\" 9:138 rename.\n5. \"Icon Btn/Light\" — 40×40 white circle surface + icon 20? Icons are 24; keep 24 inside 40 circle? Circle 40 with 24 icon → padding 8. Fine. Actually for header buttons 40×40.\n6. \"Icon Btn/Dark\" — 40×40 #1A2232 circle.\n7. \"Badge Dot\" — 8×8 red circle (used attached to bell).\n8. \"Switch/On\" — 44×26 pill brand with white knob right.\n9. \"Switch/Off\"? theme is Light mode → Notifications ON only. I'll include Switch/On only... but \"All states\" scoring; switches ON shown. Keep On only, fine. Actually add \"Switch/Off\" too — cheap.\n10. \"Chip/Rate\" (light) — exchange rate chip: 104×64? contains code (Poppins SemiBold 14), rate (Roboto Medium 14), change (Roboto Medium 11 gain). I'll make width hug? Components with fixed width 106, height 68, white surface, radius 12, subtle shadow.\n11. \"Txn Row\" (light) — 358×64: icon tile 40 (brandSoft bg radius 12, icon brand?), title Poppins Medium 14, date Roboto Regular 11 text3, right: amount Roboto SemiBold? Roboto Bold 14 text, change loss −4.5% 11.\n12. \"Section Head/Light\" — title Poppins SemiBold 16 + \"See all\" Roboto Medium 13 brand. Width 358, height 24.\n13. \"Pay Card\" — 300×180 gradient navy radius 16: chip? Mastercard logo white top-right, number Roboto Medium