{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ/ (fileKey MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ). Explicit requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account is zuohaosheng@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE — confirmed)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" (page 0:1) for product, exact screens, states, data, copy, prototype requirements\n   - Read \"01 · Foundations\" (page 1:2) for design rules (brand color #1573FE, fonts Poppins + Roboto)\n   - Reuse components from \"02 · Components\" (page 1:3) and assets from \"04 · Media\" (page 1:4)\n   - Deliver complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 8:2) — preserve all reference pages and their nodes; never modify them\n   - Build exactly 10 frames (390×844) with exact names, wire as clickable prototype with listed links\n   - Every message with a tool call must start with \"Reasoning summary:\" line; final answer must start \"Reasoning summary: ...\" then \"Final answer:\"\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for human answers\n   - Final response must include: assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n   - Forbidden API calls: loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync. Must use await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page) to change pages. Load fonts before editing text.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50000 chars per call, variables do NOT persist between calls — each call self-contained, use `return` not console.log for output)\n   - figma.getNodeByIdAsync / cloning: INSTANCE→masterComponent.clone(), COMPONENT→clone(), else createComponentFromNode(clone)\n   - Component creation, instances (comp.createInstance()), nested overrides (fills/characters on instance children)\n   - Prototype reactions: node.reactions = [{ trigger: {type:\"CLICK\"}, action: {type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.3}, preserveScrollPosition:false}}]\n   - Fonts: Poppins (Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold), Roboto (Regular/Medium/Bold); load via figma.loadFontAsync before text edits; for Inter the style is \"Semi Bold\"\n   - Icon recoloring: walk descendants, set fills (and strokes) on vector children — icons are black 24×24 glyphs, recolorable per brief; do NOT recolor brand assets (logos/coins)\n   - Design system: Banking area = light mode; Trading area = dark mode; brand primary #1573FE fixed\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ, pages: 0:1 \"00 · Start Here 设计任务”, 1:2 \"01 · Foundations 视觉规范”, 1:3 \"02 · Components 组件库”, 1:4 \"04 · Media 素材库”, 8:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (was empty, now contains 65 cloned components)\n   - 00 · Start Here brief details (node 7:2 frame, 1440×4495): LEVEL L2 design task, product \"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\". 10 frames required (exact names): 01_Welcome, 02_Photo_ID, 03_Bank_Home, 04_Bank_Transactions, 05_Profile, 06_XTrade_Welcome, 07_Trade_Home, 08_Market, 09_Exchange_Stock, 10_Exchange_Crypto.\n   - Per-frame requirements (from brief, must-include):\n     - 01_Welcome: GET STARTED · Log In (\"Already have an account?\"), copy \"Manage your finances simply\", Illustration_Welcome; LINK: GET STARTED → 02_Photo_ID\n     - 02_Photo_ID: back · TRY AGAIN · CONTINUE; camera view of ID_Card_Placeholder; \"Photo ID Card\" · \"Please point the camera at the ID card\"; LINKS: back → 01_Welcome, CONTINUE → 03_Bank_Home\n     - 03_Bank_Home: menu · contacts · notifications (unread); \"Payment card\" · 2 cards; \"Exchange rates\" AUD/EUR/GBP with rate+change · entry to all rates; nav current Home; \"Transactions\" · 3 transactions newest first · entry to all; LINKS: Transactions entry → 04_Bank_Transactions, tabs → 04/03/05\n     - 04_Bank_Transactions: history · currency exchange · notifications (unread); \"Total balance\" $41,900.10; \"Monthly budget\" $1,080.24 of $2,500 · Food & restaurants $890.12 · Tickets & Journey $190.12; \"Transactions\"; nav current Trans.; weekly: \"Transactions\" $1,041.90 · period Week · Mon 01–Sat 06 · selected Thu 04 $134.90; LINKS: tabs → 04/03/05\n     - 05_Profile: Avatar_User · Alex Morgan · alex.morgan@finx.app · +1 234 567 8901 · edit avatar; notifications · history · more menu; nav current Profile; settings: Contact us · Edit profile information · Help & Support · Language: English · Notifications: ON · Privacy policy · Security · Theme: Light mode; LINKS: tabs → 04/03/05\n     - 06_XTrade_Welcome: GET STARTED; \"FinX\" brand; \"Zero fee payment on XTrade\" · \"No 1 design for E-bank, e-wallet, personal financial mobile application.\"; LINK: GET STARTED → 07_Trade_Home\n     - 07_Trade_Home: Avatar_User · search \"Search\" · scan · notifications (unread); Banner_ETH_2_0 · Banner_Upcoming_Events; exchange rates same as 03 · See all; nav current Home; \"My Portfolios\" · See all · BTC/ETH/XRP/BNB with logo, name, holding, value, 24h change, 7-day trend; shortcuts Deposit·Earn·Gift card·More·Orders·Referral·Save coins·Shop; LINKS: BTC → 10_Exchange_Crypto, tabs → 07/08/09\n     - 08_Market: filter; 9 coins each ticker/name/24h volume/price/24h change; \"Market\"; nav current Markets; \"Search coin\"; tabs Favorites/Spot/Futures/Zones/Others current Favorites; LINKS: BTC → 10_Exchange_Crypto, tabs → 07/08/09\n     - 09_Exchange_Stock: filter · swap direction · calculator; \"Exchange\"; From AAPL (Apple Inc.) Logo_Apple $156.50 being entered · changeable; Keypad 1/2 ABC/3 DEF/4 GHI/5 JKL/6 MNO/7 PQRS/8 TUV/9 WXYZ/0/backspace; nav current Exchange; Buy/Sell current Buy; To SPOT (Spotify) Logo_Spotify ≈0.69 shares at $226.90 · changeable; LINKS: tabs → 07/08/09\n     - 10_Exchange_Crypto: \"Exchange\"; nav current Exchange; order book 5 asks + 5 bids price/amount BTC; form side Buy/Sell current Buy · type Limit (changeable) · price 29,198.00 USDT (−/+) · amount 0.0500 BTC (−/+) · 25%/50%/75%/100% · Total 1,459.90 USDT · Available 2,500.00 USDT · Buy BTC; pair BTC/USDT Logo_BTC Vol 2.8B last 29,198.24 +3.73% · changeable; view Orderbook/Chart current Orderbook; LINKS: tabs → 07/08/09\n   - Navigation structure: Banking tabs order: Trans. (→04), Feeds (entry only), Home centre (→03), Wallet (entry only), Profile (→05). Trading tabs: Home (→07), Markets (→08), Exchange centre (→09), Futures (entry), Wallets (entry). Entry-only (no frame): Log In, TRY AGAIN, menu, contacts, notifications, history, currency exchange, more menu, settings rows, edit avatar, search, scan, shortcuts, banners, See all, filter, calculator, Chart view, Sell.\n   - Fixed data (verbatim): Today Apr 13, 2022; USD. User: Alex Morgan · alex.morgan@finx.app · +1 234 567 8901 · Avatar_User. Cards: Mastercard 3141 5926 5358 9793 ALEX MORGAN Exp 06/24; Mastercard 5412 7534 0192 4467 ALEX MORGAN Exp 11/25. Rates: AUD $0.80 +0.03 (+3.9%), EUR $1.10 +0.03 (+2.8%), GBP $1.30 +0.03 (+2.4%). Transactions: Car loans (Icon_Car_Loan) $13.10 −4.5% today 9:01 AM; Mortgage real estate (Icon_Mortgage) $15.10 −1.5% Apr 12, 2022 5:01 AM; Personal loans (Icon_Personal_Loan) $41.10 −6.5% Mar 13, 2022 7:02 PM. Weekly: total $41,900.10, week $1,041.90, Mon 01 $96.40, Tue 02 $210.25, Wed 03 $305.80, Thu 04 $134.90 (selected), Fri 05 $58.20, Sat 06 $236.35. Budget: $1,080.24 spent of $2,500; Food & restaurants $890.12; Tickets & Journey $190.12. Portfolios: BTC Bitcoin 0.5000 BTC $14,599.12 +3.73%; ETH Ethereum 2.0000 ETH $3,700.24 −1.07%; XRP Ripple 5,000 XRP $2,465.00 +1.76%; BN