l required screens ... Finish with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, the screen IDs, the prototype work completed and any remaining limitations. ... Before every tool call include a concise visible decision summary in the same assistant message, prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'. After each tool result, do the same before the next tool call. For the final response, write 'Reasoning summary: ...' on the first line, then 'Final answer:' and the answer. Never issue a tool call or final answer without the required summary.\"\n   - Message 2 (Chinese): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Phase 2: Build custom reusable components on page 8:2: Button variants (Secondary outline, Disabled), dark Text Field, Icon Button, notification badge, Switch ON, Section header, Tab Bar/Bank (5 tabs: Trans./Feeds/Home/Wallet/Profile, light), Tab Bar/Trade (5 tabs: Home/Markets/Exchange/Futures/Wallets, dark), payment card, rate chip, transaction row, balance card, weekly chart card, budget card, setting row, portfolio row (with 7-day sparklines), market coin row, shortcut item, keypad key, stepper field, order book row, segmented controls, monogram coin icons (USDT/ADA/DOT/AVAX)\n   - Build 10 frames (390×844) with exact names at planned positions, light theme for banking (01–05), dark theme for trading (06–10)\n   - Wire prototype links (reactions): 01 GET STARTED→02; 02 back→01, CONTINUE→03; 03 transactions entry→04, tabs Trans.→04 Profile→05; 04 tabs Home→03 Profile→05; 05 tabs Trans.→04 Home→03; 06 GET STARTED→07; 07 BTC→10, tabs Markets→08 Exchange→09; 08 BTC→10, tabs Home→07 Exchange→09; 09 tabs Home→07 Markets→08; 10 tabs Home→07 Markets→08\n   - Take screenshots of all 10 frames, fix visual problems, re-verify\n   - Final answer with file URL, workspace page ID 8:2, frame IDs, prototype summary, limitations\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Just completed Phase 1: cloned all 65 media/shell components into workspace page 8:2 and verified via a returned JSON (component ID map 9:2–9:138 plus style details of Button 9:136, Text Field 9:138, Status Bar 9:124, Home Indicator 9:134). The immediately preceding assistant message stated: “素材齐备...开始第一阶段——把所需素材克隆为工作区组件库，并检查给定组件的内部样式\" and the verification confirmed \"count\":65 with the full map.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Proceed to Phase 2 (per my stated plan \"Build in manageable sections\"): one use_figma call that loads fonts (Poppins Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold, Roboto Regular/Medium/Bold) and creates the custom base components on page 8:2 — Button/Secondary and Button/Disabled (derived from cloned Button 9:136 styling: 342×48 radius 8 Roboto Medium 14), Icon Button (circle chip + icon instance), notification unread badge, Switch ON, Section Header (title + \"See all\"), Tab Bar/Bank and Tab Bar/Trade components (390 wide, 5 tabs using Icon_Tab_* components with icon-instance recolor overrides), plus monogram coin circle components for USDT/ADA/DOT/AVAX — all placed in the library zone (x < -100), returning their new IDs for use in frame-building phases.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/huangxinyue/bench-runs/6case-6models-v4-20261030/runs/TEST-027_1793390708512/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-huangxinyue-bench-runs-6case-6models-v4-20261030-workspace/5d351031-0fa6-4945-b5e3-9a2839717795.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept v