"Spark A\" instance at 284,20\n\nCoin Row (358×56) transparent:\n- logo Coin_BTC 32 at 0,12\n- ticker \"BTC\" Poppins SemiBold 14 white at 44,6\n- name \"Bitcoin\" Roboto Regular 11 #98A2B3 at 44,26\n- vol \"Vol 2.8B\" Roboto Regular 11 #667085 right box x180 w80 y20\n- price \"$29,198.24\" Roboto Medium 14 white right box x268 w90 y6\n- chg \"+3.73%\" Roboto Medium 11 gain right box x268 w90 y26\n\nOrder Row (358×20):\n- depth rect 140×20 r2 loss 0.10 at x 218 (right side: 358-140=218) name \"depth\"\n- price Roboto Medium 11 loss at 8,3\n- amount Roboto Regular 11 #98A2B3 right box x200 w150 y3\n\nHmm depth at right for asks default. For bids override x=0 and recolor. OK.\n\nStepper (150×44) bg #1A2232 r10:\n- minus ellipse 24 #2A3550 at 8,10; Icon_Minus 14 (rescale 14/24) white at 13,15\n- value Roboto Medium 13 white center box x36 w78 y7 h14\n- unit Roboto Regular 10 #667085 center box x36 w78 y23\n- plus ellipse at 118\n\nKey (84×60): main Roboto Regular 24 white center x0 w84 y12 h28; sub Roboto Regular 10 #667085 right box x40 w36 y38.\n\nKey/Del (84×60): Icon_Backspace 24 white at 30,18.\n\nSeg BuySell (156×32) bg #1A2232 r16: active pill 74×28 r14 gain at 2,2 with \"Buy\" Roboto Medium 13 white centered; \"Sell\" #98A2B3 Roboto Medium 13 center box x80 w74 y9.\n\nType pill (96×32) r16 #1A2232: \"Limit\" Roboto Medium 13 white at 14,8; Icon_Chevron_Down 14 #98A2B3 at 68,9.\n\nView Toggle (176×32) bg #1A2232 r16: active pill 86×28 r14 #2A3752 at 2,2 \"Orderbook\" white Roboto Medium 12 centered box; \"Chart\" #667085 Roboto Medium 12 center box x90 w84 y9.\n\nPct Chip (75×28) r8 #1A2232 \"25%\" Roboto Medium 12 #98A2B3 centered.\n\nSearch/Dark (194×40) r10 #1A2232: Icon_Search 18 (0.75) #667085 at 12,11; \"Search\" Roboto Regular 13 #667085 at 38,12.\n\nSparks: 4 components 56×24 with vectorPaths. Vector with vectorPaths: create vector, set vectorPaths, append, set strokes. Colors: A gain, B loss, C gain, D gain.\n\nWait — also need Spark/... sizes: vectorPaths coords go up to 56×24, fine.\n\nThen return the map of created component ids.\n\nAfter that, frames. Let me also think: do I need a \"Greeting\" — no, build inline.\n\nPhase 2b now.","signature":"343b9f94d614464eaada1f79"}],"id":"aa8c0151-cd98-48f8-aadb-e9f218972a32","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d351031-0fa6-4945-b5e3-9a2839717795","uuid":"747b8690-5fab-44d8-b8a1-7e5b3a2e00e9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:22:05.184Z","thinking_duration_ms":20247}
