tfolio Row instances resized? Component is 64 tall; resize instance to 60? keep 64, gap 2: 371+4*66=635 ends 635. rates head 649; chips 675..743. OK.\n  Let me use: rows y 371, 437, 503, 569 (gap 2) end 633; head rates 647; chips y 673 (68 h) end 741. nav 760. Good.\n- Portfolio data:\n  BTC Bitcoin 0.5000 BTC $14,599.12 +3.73% spark A (gain)\n  ETH Ethereum 2.0000 ETH $3,700.24 −1.07% spark B (loss) chg color loss\n  XRP Ripple 5,000 XRP $2,465.00 +1.76% spark C; logo XRP black coin → white chip wrap\n  BNB BNB 1.2000 BNB $289.56 +0.62% spark D\n  Logo handling: for BTC/ETH/BNB: swap logo instance to Coin_* rescale 0.9 (36). For XRP: the default logo child is an instance \"logo\" — I can't easily wrap in white circle; instead: hide logo instance, add white ellipse 36 + coin 28 on top at row coords (positioned relative to instance? children added to instance get positioned in instance coords — allowed). I'll add ellipse+coin into the instance at x14,y14 (ellipse 36, coin rescale 0.7 at x18,y18). Name them.\n  Change colors: chg text fills: gain #16C784 or loss #EA3943. Spark swap: spark instance swapComponent to Spark A/B/C/D. Spark colors already set per component.\n  Holding text override; ticker/name; value.\n- Rate chips dark: 3 × Chip/Rate/D at 16,673 / 142 / 268 with AUD/EUR/GBP.\n- rates head: Section Head/D \"Exchange rates\" See all.\n- nav: Tab Bar/Trade default active Exchange (t2)... wait default active in component: I made center t2 Exchange active by design (circle brand + white icon + light label). For 07 need Home active: override t0 colors → #5AA2FF, and center t2 → inactive: circle fill #1A2232? circle visible as inactive: set circ fill #232C3F, icon #66758F, label #66758F. Implement helper tradeNav(active).\n  - tradeNav(activeIdx): for side items t0,t1,t3,t4: color active #5AA2FF else #66758F (recolor children + label fills). For t2 center: if active: keep as-is (brand circle white icon); else: circ fill #232C3F, icon #66758F, label #66758F.\n- B