{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ/ (fileKey MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ). Explicit requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account is zuohaosheng@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE — confirmed in earlier session)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" (page 0:1) for product, exact screens, states, data, copy, prototype requirements; product is \"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\"\n   - Read \"01 · Foundations\" (1:2) for design rules; reuse components from \"02 · Components\" (1:3) and assets from \"04 · Media\" (1:4)\n   - Deliver complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 8:2) — preserve all reference pages and their nodes; never modify them; keep existing unrelated content intact; do not create a different file or switch accounts\n   - Build exactly 10 frames (390×844) with exact names: 01_Welcome, 02_Photo_ID, 03_Bank_Home, 04_Bank_Transactions, 05_Profile, 06_XTrade_Welcome, 07_Trade_Home, 08_Market, 09_Exchange_Stock, 10_Exchange_Crypto; wire as clickable prototype with listed links\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for human answers\n   - Use whoami → get_metadata / read-only use_figma → use_figma builds → get_screenshot verification; use supplied Figma tools directly, no delegating to other agents\n   - Use valid Figma Plugin API calls; load required fonts before editing text; build in manageable sections; forbidden: loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync; must use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` to change pages\n   - Inspect screenshots of all required screens; fix visible problems; finish screens, states and prototype flows before final answer\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response format: first line \"Reasoning summary: ...\", then \"Final answer:\" with assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50000 chars; variables do NOT persist between calls — every call self-contained; MUST `return` values, console.log is not surfaced)\n   - use_figma calls appear ATOMIC on error — failed calls leave no partial nodes (verified twice via cleanup checks)\n   - CANNOT appendChild into an INSTANCE (or node inside instance) — sibling decorations must be placed at frame level with absolute coordinates\n   - instance.swapComponent(component) for icon/logo swaps in instance slots; target name must match exactly (Coin_BNB vs Coin/BNB); after swap check size and rescale to slot size (e.g., rescale(32/lo.width))\n   - Child overrides on instances: text characters/fills via findOne(name), visibility toggles, x/y moves — all allowed; appending new children — NOT allowed\n   - recolor() walker: recurse children, set fills/strokes only on non-FRAME/GROUP/COMPONENT/TEXT/INSTANCE nodes with existing non-empty paints; TEXT labels set separately\n   - Prototype reactions: node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"CLICK\"}, action:{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.3}, preserveScrollPosition:false}}]\n   - Fonts: Poppins (Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold), Roboto (Regular/Medium/Bold) — load via figma.loadFontAsync before text ops\n   - Design system: Banking area light theme (bg #F4F6FA, surface #FFF, text #101828/#667085/#98A2B3, brand #1573FE, gain #12B76A, loss #F04438, card shadow rgba(16,24,40,0.06–0.08) y8 r24); Trading area dark (bg #0A0E17, card #121A2A, card2 #1A2232, line #232C3F, list divider #1A2334, text #F2F5F9/#98A2B3/#667085, active tab #5AA2FF, gain #16C784, loss #EA3943)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ, workspace page 8:2 \"03 · Workspace\"\n   - Frames built so far (IDs): 01_Welcome:12:2, 02_Photo_ID:12:22, 03_Bank_Home:13:2, 04_Bank_Transactions:14:2, 05_Profile:15:2, 06_XTrade_Welcome:17:2, 07_Trade_Home:17:26. Frame positions: row1 y=0 (01 x0, 02 x490, 03 x980, 04 x1470, 05 x1960); row2 y=1000 (06 x0, 07 x490, 08 x980, 09 x1470, 10 x1960)\n   - Component library on 8:2 (102 components, all looked up by NAME via comp() helper):\n     - Media clones (originals on 1:4, ids 9:2–9:113): Icon_Tab_Transactions, Icon_Tab_Feeds, Icon_Tab_Wallet, Icon_Tab_Profile, Icon_Tab_Home, Icon_Tab_Markets, Icon_Tab_Exchange, Icon_Tab_Futures, Icon_Menu, Icon_Contacts, Icon_Notification, Icon_History, Icon_Currency_Exchange, Icon_More, Icon_Scan, Icon_Filter, Icon_Back, Icon_Search, Icon_Deposit, Icon_Referral, Icon_Earn, Icon_Save_Coins, Icon_Orders, Icon_Shop, Icon_Gift_Card, Icon_More_Horizontal, Icon_Arrow_Up_Right, Icon_Chevron_Right, Icon_Chevron_Down, Icon_Food, Icon_Ticket, Icon_Car_Loan, Icon_Mortgage, Icon_Personal_Loan, Icon_Edit_Profile, Icon_Language, Icon_Help, Icon_Contact_Us, Icon_Privacy, Icon_Security, Icon_Theme, Icon_Edit, Icon_Calculator, Icon_Backspace, Icon_Swap, Icon_Dropdown, Icon_Minus, Icon_Plus, Logo_Apple, Logo_Spotify, Logo_Mastercard, Coin_BTC, Coin_ETH, Coin_XRP, Coin_BNB, Coin_SOL, Avatar_User, Banner_ETH_2_0, Banner_Upcoming_Events, Illustration_Welcome, ID_Card_Placeholder\n     - Given shells (renamed): Shell/Status Bar (9:124), Shell/Home Indicator (9:134), Btn/Primary (9:136), Input/Light (9:138)\n     - Phase 2a created: Btn/Secondary (white fill, brand stroke+text), Btn/Disabled (#B9C6D8), Icon Btn (40 circle white+shadow, child \"icon\"), Icon Btn/Dark (fill