d; only transition invalid.\n\nSo transition must be: {type: \"MOVE_IN\"|\"MOVE_OUT\"|\"PUSH\"|\"SLIDE_IN\"|\"SLIDE_OUT\", direction, matchLayers, easing} — OR maybe DISSOLVE/SMART_ANIMATE with {duration, easing}? The union had only two branches: directional (with easing required) and null. Hmm — \"Expected [0].action.transition to be one of the following, but none matched:\" then two sub-branches. Branch 1 combined requirements: easing missing, type invalid (enum MOVE_IN...), direction missing, matchLayers missing — that looks like the typed \"Transition\" union where directional transitions require direction+easing+matchLayers, and the enum message lumped all directional types. But where are DISSOLVE/SMART_ANIMATE simple transitions ({type, duration, easing})? In modern typings, TimedTransition = {type:'DISSOLVE'|'SMART_ANIMATE'|'MOVE_IN'|..., duration, easing}. The enum error listed only MOVE_IN|MOVE_OUT|PUSH|SLIDE_IN|SLIDE_OUT — no DISSOLVE/SMART_ANIMATE. That suggests this schema's directional branch only accepts those 5, and there's no simple timed branch — odd, but maybe simple transitions are the branch \"Expected null\" ... no.\n\nSafest: use a directional transition with all required fields: {type:\"SLIDE_LEFT\"? no...} — enum: \"MOVE_IN\"|\"MOVE_OUT\"|\"PUSH\"|\"SLIDE_IN\"|\"SLIDE_OUT\", required direction and matchLayers and easing. Direction likely \"LEFT\"|\"RIGHT\"|\"TOP\"|\"BOTTOM\". easing must be an easing object like {type:\"EASE_OUT\"}? or {type:\"GENERIC_EASING\", ...}? In plugin API, Easing = {type: 'EASE_IN_AND_OUT'|'EASE_IN'|'EASE_OUT'|'LINEAR'|'EASE_IN_BACK'|'EASE_OUT_BACK'|'EASE_IN_AND_OUT_BACK'|'BOUNCY'|'CUSTOM_CUBIC_BEZIER', ...}. Use {type:\"EASE_OUT\"}.\n\nSo reaction: \n{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, action:{type:\"NODE\", destinationId:id, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"SLIDE_LEFT\"?...}}}\n\nHmm — direction values in Figma REST: for PUSH/SLIDE_IN/SLIDE_OUT/MOVE_IN/MOVE_OUT: direction: \"LEFT\"|\"RIGHT\"|\"TOP\"|\"BOTTOM\"