{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ/ (fileKey MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ). Explicit requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account is zuohaosheng@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE — confirmed in earlier session)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" (page 0:1) for product, exact screens, states, data, copy, prototype requirements; product is \"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\"\n   - Read \"01 · Foundations\" (1:2) for design rules; reuse components from \"02 · Components\" (1:3) and assets from \"04 · Media\" (1:4)\n   - Deliver complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 8:2) — preserve all reference pages and their nodes; never modify them; keep existing unrelated content intact; do not create a different file or switch accounts/teams\n   - Build exactly 10 frames (390×844) with exact names: 01_Welcome, 02_Photo_ID, 03_Bank_Home, 04_Bank_Transactions, 05_Profile, 06_XTrade_Welcome, 07_Trade_Home, 08_Market, 09_Exchange_Stock, 10_Exchange_Crypto; wire as clickable prototype with the brief's listed links\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for human answers\n   - Use whoami → get_metadata / read-only use_figma → use_figma builds → get_screenshot verification; use supplied Figma tools directly, no delegating to other agents\n   - Use valid Figma Plugin API calls; load fonts before editing text; build in manageable sections; forbidden: loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync; use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` to change pages\n   - Inspect screenshots of all required screens; fix visible problems; finish screens, states and prototype flows before final answer\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\"; final response format: first line \"Reasoning summary: ...\", then \"Final answer:\" with assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code ≤50000 chars; return values must stay <48000 bytes or run is rejected UNCOMMITTED; variables do NOT persist between calls — every call self-contained; MUST `return` values)\n   - use_figma failed calls are ATOMIC (verified 4 times: no partial nodes left behind; still, each rebuild includes a cleanup guard)\n   - REACTION FORMAT (this environment's validated schema — critical): `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"<frameId>\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}},preserveScrollPosition:false}]}]` — plural `actions` array (NOT `action`); trigger type \"ON_CLICK\" (NOT \"CLICK\"); DISSOLVE also works; directional transitions (PUSH/SLIDE_IN etc.) fail with action-field errors\n   - CANNOT set x/y (relative-transform) on children INSIDE an instance — build widened custom components manually instead\n   - Figma nodes have NO `.lastChild` property — capture returned references instead\n   - CANNOT appendChild into an instance — frame-level absolute positioning for sibling decorations (white chips behind black coins)\n   - Component child names (verified read-only): Pct Chip → TEXT \"t\"; Btn/Primary → TEXT \"GET STARTED\"; Type Pill → TEXT \"t\"+INSTANCE \"ch\"; Seg BuySell → FRAME \"active\"+TEXT \"t2\"; View Toggle → FRAME \"active\"+TEXT \"t2\"; Key → TEXT \"k\"+TEXT \"sub\"; Key/Del → INSTANCE \"icon\"; Coin Row → INSTANCE logo + ticker/name/vol/price/chg; Section Head → title/link\n   - Coin component names: Coin_BTC, Coin_ETH, Coin_XRP, Coin_BNB (underscore!), Coin_SOL, Coin/USDT, Coin/ADA, Coin/DOT, Coin/AVAX\n   - NO shell/Read/Write/Bash tools available — screenshot URLs cannot be curl'd; must use get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true (inline base64) for visual inspection\n   - Fonts: Poppins (Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold), Roboto (Regular/Medium/Bold) — load via figma.loadFontAsync before text ops\n   - Design system: Banking light (bg #F4F6FA, brand #1573FE, gain #12B76A, loss #F04438); Trading dark (bg #0A0E17, card #121A2A, line #1A2334, text #F2F5F9/#98A2B3/#667085, active tab #5AA2FF, gain #16C784, loss #EA3943)\n   - Standard helper preamble per call: loadFonts → H/S color helpers → comp() name lookup → recolor walker (skips FRAME/GROUP/COMPONENT/TEXT/INSTANCE/BOOLEAN_OPERATION) → junk cleanup → FR/statusBar/homeInd/T/setTxt helpers\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ, workspace page 8:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (~102 components + 10 frames)\n   - ALL 10 FRAME IDs (complete): 01_Welcome: 12:2 · 02_Photo_ID: 12:22 · 03_Bank_Home: 13:2 · 04_Bank_Transactions: 14:2 · 05_Profile: 15:2 · 06_XTrade_Welcome: 17:2 · 07_Trade_Home: 17:26 · 08_Market: 18:453 · 09_Exchange_Stock: 20:56 · 10_Exchange_Crypto: 24:2\n   - Frame positions: row1 y=0 (01 x0, 02 x490, 03 x980, 04 x1470, 05 x1960); row2 y=1000 (06 x0, 07 x490, 08 x980, 09 x1470, 10 x1960)\n   - 08_Market build (18:453, succeeded): title \"Market\" 22 at 16,56; Icon Btn/Dark \"filterBtn\" 334,54; Search/Dark resized 358×40 at 16,108; tabs Favorites/Spot/Futures/Zones/Others xs 16/106/166/240/306 y164 (active #FFFFFF else #667085); underline 66×3 #1573FE at 16,188; 9 Coin Rows y206+i*56 + dividers 358×1 #1A2334 at ry+55 (i<8); coins: [Coin_BTC/BTC/Bitcoin/Vol 2.8B/$29,198.24/+3.73%], [Coin_ETH/−1.07% #EA3943], [Coin/USDT/TetherUS/$1.00/+0.01%], [Coin_BNB/$241.30/+0.62%], [Coin/ADA/$0.2874/−0.62%], [Coin_XRP whiteChip], [Coin_SOL whiteChip], [Coin/DOT/$4.92/+0.84%], [Coin/AVAX/$11.36/−0.45%]; whiteChip: logo.visible=false + white ellipse 32 at frame level (16,ry+12) + coin rescale(24/40) at (20,ry+16); nav Markets active (side t1 #5AA2FF else #66758F; center t2 inactive: circ #232C3F, icon/label #66758F)\n   - 09_Exchange_Stock build (20:56): title \"Exchange\" 20 centered; filterBtn Icon Btn/Dark 334,54; Seg BuySell 16,104; calcBtn Icon Btn/Dark 334,100; buildCard() helper creates 358×92 r14 #121A2A cards: fromCard y152 (From / Logo_Apple rescale-to-40 at 16,34 / \"AAPL\" Poppins SemiBold 16 at 66,36 / \"Apple Inc.\" 11 #98A2B3 at 66,60 / Icon_Chevron_Down rescale(14/24) at 112,40 recolored #667085 / \"$156.50\" Roboto Bold 24 at x=342−width−12, y30 / cursor 2×26 #1573FE at 340,34); toCard y258 (To / Logo_Spotify / \"SPOT\"/\"Spotify\" / \"≈ 0.69 shares\" Bold 20 right / \"$226.90 / share\" 11 #8A94A8 right-aligned w160 box at x=342−160−12); swapCircle ellipse 36 #1A2232 at 177,229 + Icon_Swap rescale(18/24) white at 186,238; keypad: Key instances at kxs[16,153,290] × kys[374,452,530,608] — 1(\"\") 2(ABC) 3(DEF) 4(GHI) 5(JKL) 6(MNO) 7(PQRS) 8(TUV) 9(WXYZ) blank(\" \") 0(\" \") via setTxt on \"k\"/\"sub\"; Key/Del at 290,608; nav default Exchange-active; homeInd white\n   - 10_Exchange_Crypto build (24:2): pair header — Coin_BTC rescale(32/40) at 16,54; \"BTC / USDT\" 17 at 56,52; chevron 142,57; \"Vol 2.8B\" 11 #667085 at 56,78; \"29,198.24\" Roboto Medium 13 right w120 x280 y76; \"+3.73%\" #16C784 right w70 x284; View Toggle 16,110; orderBook frame 358×278 r14 #121A2A at 16,154 — headers \"Price\"/\"Amount (BTC)\" 10 #667085; 5 asks y30+i*22 (depth rect right-anchored x=342−16−w, w=max(8,amt/0.2104*150), #EA3943 10%; price Roboto Medium 11 #EA3943 at 16; amount #98A2B3 right w80): 29,203.00·0.0446 / 29,201.80·0.1185 / 29,200.65·0.0797 / 29,199.40·0.0032 / 29,198.50·0.1852; mid \"29,198.24\" Bold 15 centered w326 y142 + \"≈ $29,198.24\" 10 y162; 5 bids y184+i*22 (#16C784, depth left-anchored x16): 29,198.00·0.2104 / 29,196.75·0.0446 / 29,195.20·0.1185 / 29,194.10·0.0797 / 29,193.50·0.0560; orderForm frame 358×296 at 16,448 — Seg BuySell 16,12; Type Pill 246,12; MANUAL steppers (function step(nm,y,val,unit): frame 326×44 r10 #1A2232 + mb ellipse 24 #232C3F at 8,10 + Icon_Minus rescale(14/24) white at 13,15 + val/unit centered w78 texts at x=(326−78)/2 + pb ellipse at 326−32 + Icon_Plus at 326−27): priceStep y52 \"29,198.00\"/\"USDT\", amtStep y104 \"0.0500\"/\"BTC\"; 4 Pct Chips at 16+i*83 y156 with setTxt(pc,\"t\",pcts[i]); \"Total\" 12 #98A2B3 y194 + \"1,459.90 USDT\" right w160; \"Available\" y218 + \"2,500.00 USDT\" right; buyBtn Btn/Primary resized 326×44 at 16,240 with findOne(name===\"GET STARTED\").characters=\"Buy BTC\"; nav default; homeInd white\n   - Prototype wiring (COMPLETED, ok:21 fail:0) — exact code pattern used:\n     ```js\n     function rx(destId){return [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:destId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}},preserveScrollPosition:false}]}];}\n     ```\n     Links wired: 01 cta→12:22; 02 backBtn→12:2, continueBtn→13:2; 03 txnHead link (found via headByTitle(f3,\"Transactions\").findOne(name===\"link\"))→14:2, nav t0→14:2, nav t4→15:2; 04 nav t2→13:2, t4→15:2; 05 nav t0→14:2, t2→13:2; 06 cta→17:26; 07 pf BTC row (rowByTicker)→24:2, nav t1→18:453, t2→20:56; 08 coin BTC row→24:2, nav t0→17:26, t2→20:56; 09 nav t0→17:26, t1→18:453; 10 nav t0→17:26, t1→18:453\n     Helper functions used: navTab(frame,i)=frame.findOne(name===\"nav\").findOne(name===\"t\"+i); rowByTicker(frame,tk)=findAll INSTANCE with findOne(name===\"ticker\"&&TEXT).characters===tk; headByTitle(frame,txt)=INSTANCE with findOne(name===\"title\").characters===txt\n   - Screenshot verification: row 1 (12:2, 12:22, 13:2, 14:2, 15:2) captured via get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true, maxDimension:512 — all 5 inspected and look correct (01 Welcome: brand/illustration/headline/GET STARTED/Log In; 02 Photo ID: viewfinder+ID card+tip pill+TRY AGAIN/CONTINUE; 03 Bank Home: greeting/pay card+peek/dots/rate chips/3 txn rows/nav Home active; 04 Transactions: balance/weekly chart+tooltip/budget bars/nav Trans active; 05 Profile: avatar card/settings rows/switch on/nav Profile active). Row-1 image URLs (short-lived): dba6a624 (01), 8be93523 (02), 7cecd855 (03), 716fcd08 (04), b18d04ca (05)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - 09 build attempt 1 — \"TypeError: cannot read property 'swapComponent' of null\" at line 25: buildCard created a plain FRAME but code called swap(from,\"logo\",...) / setTxt(from,\"ticker\",...) on it (no such children). Fix: construct card contents manually (logo instance, T() texts) via a buildCard helper returning the card reference\n   - 09 build attempt 2 — \"TypeError: node.lastChild: no such property 'lastChild' on FRAME node\": used DOM-style f.lastChild. Fix: capture the buildCard return value (`const fc=await buildCard(...)`) and appendChild cursor to it\n   - 10 build attempt 1 — \"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\": setting pb.x on a child inside the resized Stepper instance. Fix: build 326-wide steppers manually (frame + ellipses + Icon_Minus/Icon_Plus instances + T() val/unit)\n   - 10 build attempt 2 — \"ReferenceError: 'setTxt' is not defined\": helper was dropped from preamble but still used for pct chips. Fix: restore setTxt definition\n   - 10 build attempt 3 — \"TypeError: cannot set property 'characters' of null\": setTxt(pc,\"pct\",...) — Pct Chip's text child is named \"t\", not \"pct\". Fix: read-only inspection revealed all component child names; used setTxt(pc,\"t\",...) and buy label override via findOne(name===\"GET STARTED\")\n   - Prototype wiring attempt 1 — \"Return value exceeds the 48000-byte limit (96829 bytes). Canvas edits from this run were not committed\": overly verbose return. Fix: