{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full Figma product design benchmark in the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ/ (fileKey MoQG8UU1zIAlfnI9lRfjNZ). Explicit requirements:\n   - Confirm assigned account is zuohaosheng@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE in earlier session)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" (0:1) for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; product is \"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\"; if external query names disagree, use 00 · Start Here\n   - Read \"01 · Foundations\" (1:2) for design rules/fonts/colors; reuse components from \"02 · Components\" (1:3); reuse assets from \"04 · Media\" (1:4)\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their existing nodes; never modify them; keep existing unrelated content intact; do not create a different file or switch accounts/teams\n   - Deliver complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 8:2); new frames/components/prototype connections allowed there\n   - Build exactly 10 frames (390×844) named: 01_Welcome, 02_Photo_ID, 03_Bank_Home, 04_Bank_Transactions, 05_Profile, 06_XTrade_Welcome, 07_Trade_Home, 08_Market, 09_Exchange_Stock, 10_Exchange_Crypto; wire as clickable prototype with the brief's listed links\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting\n   - Use whoami → get_metadata/read-only use_figma → use_figma builds → get_screenshot verification; use supplied Figma tools directly, no delegation\n   - Valid Plugin API calls; load fonts before text edits; build in manageable sections; forbidden: loadAllPagesAsync, setPlugin