Clear fills on all \"icon\" instances ≤40 in all 10 frames.\n2. Enumerate all instances in f5 (15:2) and f10 (24:2) with name+size+fills (root only, depth 2) to identify Setting Rows and pill.\n3. Delete frame 36:610.\n4. Return compact summary.\n\nCode:\n\n```js\nconst frameIds=[\"12:2\",\"12:22\",\"13:2\",\"14:2\",\"15:2\",\"17:2\",\"17:26\",\"18:453\",\"20:56\",\"24:2\"];\nlet cleared=0;const perFrame={};\nfor(const fid of frameIds){const fr=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(fid);if(!fr)continue;let c=0;const icons=fr.findAll(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\"&&n.name===\"icon\"&&n.width<=40&&n.height<=40);for(const ic of icons){try{if(ic.fills&&ic.fills!==\"mixed\"&&ic.fills.length>0){ic.fills=[];c++;}}catch(e){}}cleared+=c;perFrame[fid]=c+\"x\"+icons.length;}\n```\n\nHmm wait, `ic.fills.length>0` — if fills is symbol? It's arrays normally. ok.\n\nWait — also should I clear fills on instances named \"icon\" INSIDE masters on components page? The broken masters (Type Pill ch, Setting Row chev/icon) — but I couldn't find \"Type Pill\" or \"Setting\" names. Enumerate masters too? Let me also enumerate ALL components on page 1:3 names compactly? That could be ~100 names → fine, ~2KB. Actually I already know most names. Let me enumerate components with names matching /Pill|Setting|Row/i and their trees.\n\nEnumeration for f5/f10 instances:\n\n```js\nfunction enumInst(fr){return fr.findAll(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\").map(n=>n.name+\" \"+Math.round(n.width)+\"x\"+Math.round(n.height)+\"@\"+Math.round(n.x)+\",\"+Math.round(n.y)+\" f:\"+fs(n.fills));}\n```\n\nFor f5, that's maybe 10-15 instances (3 buttons + 6 rows + chevs? chevs are inside rows). Output fine. f10: pill etc.\n\nfs helper needed again.\n\nDelete test frame:\n```js\nconst tf=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"36:610\");if(tf)tf.remove();\n```\n\nReturn JSON compact.\n\nOne concern: clearing icon fills inside f6 17:2? f6 is XTrade welcome — has icon instances? Maybe the logo. name===\"icon\" only. Safe.\n\nAlso — hmm, what abou